        "Description": "Good evening 47\r\rThe elimination of the Handprint lead us to Berlin, Club Hölle. While most Blue Blood members are busy manipulation the most powerful individuals, some just like to party, or &quot;connect&quot;, as they put it. These people are part of a group that calls itselve &apos;The Royal Flush&apos;, with the others operating in New York. Their leader is Vasilis The Beast and he should have intel on the Inquisitor. Make sure the cameras don&apos;t spot you, we don&apos;t want to draw more attention. \r\rGood luck 47",
